# Runner safety

- One branch per job; never checkout over dirty working tree.
- No commit unless job says `commit: true`.
- No merge to protected branches.
- No destructive moves without dry-run + approval.
- Report every verify command with exit code.
- Stop on instruction conflict; do not guess.
